WEBVTT

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.176
obedience, submission.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.096
Or at least if I submitted,
they wouldn't bother me too much.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.856
So I took a bargain

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:13.216
that I'd later see in a prison,
a Stasi prison in Berlin,

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.696
on a sign that read,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.720
"He who adapts can live tolerably."

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.935
It was a bargain that helped ensure

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:25.096
I had a place to stay and food to eat;

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:29.416
a bargain that won me praise
of teachers and kin, strangers;

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.576
a bargain that paid off
big time, it seemed,